rticipants. </em>For detailed information and registration, please contact us via DM.</span></p>"}, "isRecurring": {"to": false}, "memberPrice": {"to": "500", "from": 500}, "whatsappUrl": {"to": null}, "refundPolicy": {"to": null}, "approvalRequired": {"to": false}, "coverImagePosition": {"to": 60}, "registrationDeadline": {"to": null}}, "title": "Glow Sunday✨ Faceyoga workshop"}	2026-05-21 20:21:35.353	Updated event "Glow Sunday✨ Faceyoga workshop"
