cmq6x15s600pomf6f2ong18g4	cmoofepme0000bj6fkazj835e	Admin	event.update	cmq6nky4r00f4mf6fvli1l4p0	event	{"diff": {"lat": {"to": null}, "lng": {"to": null}, "emoji": {"to": "🥾", "from": "🎉"}, "price": {"to": "250", "from": 250}, "vibes": {"to": []}, "maxAge": {"to": null}, "minAge": {"to": null}, "status": {"to": "published", "from": "pending"}, "address": {"to": "Burgaz Adası"}, "endTime": {"to": ""}, "language": {"to": null}, "coverImage": {"to": "/app/api/files/events/1781010254659-3b7b250d097b.jpg"}, "meetingUrl": {"to": null}, "totalSpots": {"to": "20", "from": 20}, "description": {"to": "<p>hiking at  Burgaz Adası </p><p>📆 Date: Sunday 14 june</p><p>⏰ Time: 10.30</p><p>🙋🏻‍♀️ Host: hani</p><p>🏡 Group: Hiking club</p><p>💰 Fee: 250</p><p>🙂 Participants: 20</p><p>📍 Meeting Point: Bostanci / Büyükada Pier</p><p>🗺 Address: <a target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\" href=\\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/obp6mdfreTCMv1T59?g_st=ic\\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/obp6mdfreTCMv1T59?g_st=ic</a></p><p>This Sunday, June 14, we’re heading to Burgaz Adası for a day of hiking,  island adventure!  And swimming </p><p>We’ll meet at bostancı İskelesi and travel together, so be sure to reserve your spot and arrive on time.</p><p>The weather looks  sunny , blue water, and a refreshing  sea. We’ll start with a short hike on the roads, then follow the shoreline into the forest.and at the end we can find a peaceful beach for swimming or just relaxing </p><p><em>Description:</em></p><p>We will meet in Bostancı at 11.30 and take the 12:00 ferry from Bostancı to Burgaz Adası.</p><p><em>Details:</em></p><p>* Distance: around 6/7 km</p><p>* Difficulty: 1/5</p><p><em>What to Bring:</em></p><p>* Water, food, snacks</p><p>👕 Clothing:</p><p>Warm layers (thermal / fleece) </p><p>🥾 Footwear:</p><p>Hiking shoes with good grip</p><p>🎒 Gear:</p><p>Small backpack + rain cover</p><p>1–1.5 L of water</p><p>Snacks (fruits, nuts, energy bars)</p><p>Power bank</p><p>Personal medicine</p><p>🌞 Optional / Useful:</p><p>Neck warmer / scarf</p><p>Small towel / wet wipes</p><p>Plastic bag to keep wet clothes separate</p><p>Pace yourself, it’s not a race 🐢</p><p>Stay with the group and follow the guide’s instructions for safety.</p><p>Leave no trace – keep the forest clean 🌿 and carry your trash with you.</p>"}, "isRecurring": {"to": false}, "memberPrice": {"to": "", "from": null}, "membersOnly": {"to": true, "from": false}, "whatsappUrl": {"to": null}, "refundPolicy": {"to": null}, "approvalRequired": {"to": false}, "coverImagePosition": {"to": 50}, "registrationDeadline": {"to": null}}, "title": "Hiking in Burgaz Adası"}	2026-06-09 17:30:29.382	Updated event "Hiking in Burgaz Adası"
