cmq9akwnb032tmf6fuwqsfl2q	cmoofepme0000bj6fkazj835e	Admin	event.update	cmq6nky4r00f4mf6fvli1l4p0	event	{"diff": {"lat": {"to": null}, "lng": {"to": null}, "price": {"to": "250", "from": 250}, "vibes": {"to": []}, "maxAge": {"to": null}, "minAge": {"to": null}, "address": {"to": "Burgaz Adası"}, "endTime": {"to": ""}, "language": {"to": null}, "coverImage": {"to": "/app/api/files/events/1781010254659-3b7b250d097b.jpg"}, "meetingUrl": {"to": null}, "totalSpots": {"to": "20", "from": 20}, "description": {"to": "<p><span>Escape the city and discover one of Istanbul’s most peaceful island hiking experiences on beautiful Burgazada. Surrounded by pine forests, sea views, historic mansions, and quiet pathways, Burgazada offers a relaxing nature walk far from the noise and traffic of the city. The island’s highest point, Bayraktepe (Hristos Hill), rewards hikers with panoramic views of the Marmara Sea, neighboring islands, and the Istanbul skyline.</span></p><p></p><p>📆 Date: Sunday 14 june</p><p>⏰ Time: 10.30</p><p>🙋🏻‍♀️ Host: hani</p><p>🏡 Group: Hiking club</p><p>💰 Fee: 250</p><p>🙂 Participants: 20</p><p>📍 Meeting Point: Bostanci / Büyükada Pier</p><p>🗺 Address: <a target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\" href=\\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/obp6mdfreTCMv1T59?g_st=ic\\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/obp6mdfreTCMv1T59?</a></p><p></p><p>This Sunday, June 14, we’re heading to Burgaz Adası for a day of hiking, island adventure! And swimming</p><p>We’ll meet at bostancı İskelesi and travel together, so be sure to reserve your spot and arrive on time.</p><p>The weather looks sunny , blue water, and a refreshing sea. We’ll start with a short hike on the roads, then follow the shoreline into the forest.and at the end we can find a peaceful beach for swimming or just relaxing</p><p><em>Description:</em></p><p>We will meet in Bostancı at 11.30 and take the 12:00 ferry from Bostancı to Burgaz Adası.</p><p><em>Details:</em></p><p>* Distance: around 6/7 km</p><p>* Difficulty: 1/5</p><p><em>What to Bring:</em></p><p>* Water, food, snacks</p><p>👕 Clothing:</p><p>Warm layers (thermal / fleece)</p><p>🥾 Footwear:</p><p>Hiking shoes with good grip</p><p>🎒 Gear:</p><p>Small backpack + rain cover</p><p>1–1.5 L of water</p><p>Snacks (fruits, nuts, energy bars)</p><p>Power bank</p><p>Personal medicine</p><p>🌞 Optional / Useful:</p><p>Neck warmer / scarf</p><p>Small towel / wet wipes</p><p>Plastic bag to keep wet clothes separate</p><p>Pace yourself, it’s not a race 🐢</p><p>Stay with the group and follow the guide’s instructions for safety.</p><p>Leave no trace – keep the forest clean 🌿 and carry your trash with you.</p>"}, "isRecurring": {"to": false}, "memberPrice": {"to": "", "from": null}, "whatsappUrl": {"to": null}, "refundPolicy": {"to": null}, "approvalRequired": {"to": false}, "coverImagePosition": {"to": 50}, "registrationDeadline": {"to": null}}, "title": "Hiking in Burgaz Adası"}	2026-06-11 09:25:18.023	Updated event "Hiking in Burgaz Adası"
