hat to Bring:</em></p><p>* Water, food, snacks</p><p>👕 Clothing:</p><p>Warm layers (thermal / fleece)</p><p>🥾 Footwear:</p><p>Hiking shoes with good grip</p><p>🎒 Gear:</p><p>Small backpack + rain cover</p><p>1–1.5 L of water</p><p>Snacks (fruits, nuts, energy bars)</p><p>Power bank</p><p>Personal medicine</p><p>🌞 Optional / Useful:</p><p>Neck warmer / scarf</p><p>Small towel / wet wipes</p><p>Plastic bag to keep wet clothes separate</p><p>Pace yourself, it’s not a race 🐢</p><p>Stay with the group and follow the guide’s instructions for safety.</p><p>Leave no trace – keep the forest clean 🌿 and carry your trash with you.</p>"}, "isRecurring": {"to": false}, "memberPrice": {"to": "", "from": null}, "whatsappUrl": {"to": null}, "refundPolicy": {"to": null}, "approvalRequired": {"to": false}, "coverImagePosition": {"to": 50}, "registrationDeadline": {"to": null}}, "title": "Hiking in Burgaz Adası"}	2026-06-11 09:26:52.092	Updated event "Hiking in Burgaz Adası"
