cmq50vtic004zdz6f3rjh4r7o	Duvar Coffee Collective	Cafe	Duvar Coffee Collective is a community-focused specialty coffee shop in the heart of Kadıköy, Istanbul. Designed for digital nomads, remote workers, creatives, and travelers, we offer a welcoming space where great coffee meets meaningful connections.\n\nWith reliable Wi-Fi, comfortable workspaces, and a friendly atmosphere, Duvar is more than a café—it’s a place to work, create, and meet people from around the world. We regularly host networking events, language exchanges, workshops, art exhibitions, live music sessions, and community gatherings that bring locals and internationals together.\n\nWhether you’re looking for a productive workspace, a new social circle, or an authentic local experience in Istanbul, you’ll find a home at Duvar.\n\nWork remotely. Connect locally.	Kadıköy	Meltem Street	+905317487975	https://www.Duvarcoffee.com.tr	duvar.coffee.collective	\N	\N	f	t	English,Turkish	f	t	cmq0zuaoi00gpys6fpuft2h53	\N	\N	2026-06-08 09:42:46.308	2026-06-08 09:42:46.308	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	{}
