COPY public.club_posts (id, "clubId", "userId", content, "createdAt", "updatedAt", "isPinned", "pinnedAt", type) FROM stdin;
cmoy60qoa0008ub6f70jtt0al	cmowz5dv10000c16f6ewnnrkp	cmottv0iz00071b6frg92x003	Hello everyone. Welcome to the club.	2026-05-09 09:52:28.426	2026-05-09 09:52:28.426	f	\N	post
cmpl2lyvj003miv6f87774khr	cmoyctrne0000u16f7fivkwvg	cmp04kc1u00031y6fgvgmv5wj	Hi friends I will be İn Kahve Dünyası in front of CKM around 20 00. If you come early, please let me know	2026-05-25 10:35:42.415	2026-05-25 10:35:42.415	f	\N	post
cmppar43w002s5f6fduez45yq	cmoqs1j5z00048p6f4pad04aw	cmp07ond20001wc6fod5mgah0	A very enjoyable event, filled with enthusiasm and energy befitting the holiday, has come to an end. Happy and wonderful people created a beautiful synergy together last night. \n\nThanks Nate for bringing us together.\nThanks Fioana and Alper for language hosting.\nThanks DJ. Nouaim for his great performance,  \nThe dance floor remained full until late hours with amazing tracks.\n\nThis week's special thanks go to Cansu. Despite not being fully recovered from her illness, she came to the event to be with us, danced despite her crutches, and always had a smile on her face.\n\nTogether, we continue to write beautiful stories and create unforgettable memories. Your enthusiastic participation and your strong sense of ownership of the event motivates us greatly.\n\n A reminder to those who added their names to the event list last night but didn't show up. We organize these events with great dedication and sacrifice. If you won't be able to attend, we expect you to remove your name from the list or inform us. This is a matter of respect for us, for the other participants, and for all the effort put in.* \n *We kindly request that you demonstrate the necessary care, respect, and maturity in this matter at the next events.	2026-05-28 09:34:44.108	2026-05-28 09:34:44.108	f	\N	announcement
cmpz6zjbv002ll96f50dvyiwj	cmoqs1j5z00048p6f4pad04aw	cmp07ond20001wc6fod5mgah0	We had another enjoyable Wednesday filled with the energy of summer. We had so much fun, danced a lot, and had wonderful conversations.\n\nThanks Nate for bringing us together.\n\nThanks Jeremy and Alper for language hosting.\n\nThanks DJ. Nouaim for his amazing performance, The energy and excitement of the night never diminished.\n\nWe often get asked why we organize this event on Wednesdays instead of the weekend. The answer is simple. The Social Wednesday Event allows you to escape from your busy work life and exhausting school schedule in the middle of the week, giving you a chance to breathe. In other words, it's a secret garden where many people feel good.	2026-06-04 07:47:00.379	2026-06-04 07:47:00.379	f	\N	announcement
cmq9p9dy603kmmf6f1lz7la72	cmoqs1j5z00048p6f4pad04aw	cmp07ond20001wc6fod5mgah0	As you've probably noticed, Social Wednesday Events have become an important part of your lives. New commers will soon understand  what we mean. Once again, we enjoyed meeting new people, danced a lot, and had great time together.\n\nThanks Nate for bringing us together.\nThanks Indie and Alper for language hosting.\nThanks DJ. Nouaim for he was again on fire,  Performed a great Djing. \nThank you all so much for your participations, your energies, and for being with us. You can contribute to this wonderful event by referring your friends, DJing, language hosting, or sharing your ideas to make the event even better.\nWe are so much better together...	2026-06-11 16:16:14.814	2026-06-11 16:16:14.814	f	\N	announcement
cmqf4l63n003qt76f0pd1g61g	cmoyctrne0000u16f7fivkwvg	cmp04kc1u00031y6fgvgmv5wj	Hi friends, I will be at Kahve Dünyası around 8. That's in front of CKM building. Please come inside once you arrive. And remove your name if you don't come. Thanks	2026-06-15 11:24:09.635	2026-06-15 11:24:09.635	f	\N	post
cmqjea37p0033yd6fmozf7rc0	cmoqs1j5z00048p6f4pad04aw	cmp07ond20001wc6fod5mgah0	Last night, we held our first event where participation and check-in were only open to the app. Since future events will be held this way, we strongly urge you to participate via the app.\nThis is very important for us and to ensure that the events can proceed more smoothly.\n\nThanks Nate for bringing us together.\nThanks Mark and  Sergen for language hosting.\nThanks Tolunay.Despite technical issues beyond our control and originating from the operation, it performed very well.\n\nEnjoyable conversations, positive energy, happy moments, smiling faces. All these and more is possible thanks to you. Thank you to everyone who came.	2026-06-18 11:06:33.542	2026-06-18 11:06:33.542	f	\N	announcement
\.
