cmqget7ig00v5t76ft2xki85a	Hidden Ottoman Istanbul Walk	<p>Join us for a walk through some of Istanbul’s hidden historical gems and lesser-known corners of the Old City.</p><p></p><p>We’ll begin at <strong>Sağır Han (Eirene Tower)</strong>, exploring its unique atmosphere and small art exhibition. From there, we’ll continue to <strong>Büyük Valide Han</strong> <em>(optional / flexible stop depending on access and group preference)</em>, where we may enjoy one of the most fascinating rooftop viewpoints in historic Istanbul.</p><p></p><p>Our next stop will be <strong>Hünkar Kasrı </strong><em>(optional / flexible stop depending on access and group preference)</em>,, a hidden Ottoman pavilion overlooking the Golden Horn. Finally, we’ll end the day at <strong>Süleymaniye Mosque</strong>, enjoying panoramic city views and taking photos as the perfect finale to our walk.</p><p>📸 Hidden courtyards, Ottoman history, panoramic views, and great company.</p><p></p><p>📅 Date: Saturday, June 20<br>🕝 Time: 14:30</p><p></p><p>📍 Route (Flexible):<br>Sağır Han (Eirene Tower) → Büyük Valide Han (Optional) → Hünkar Kasrı (Optional) → Süleymaniye Mosque</p>	2026-06-20	14:30	Sağır Han (Eirene Tower)	Eminönü	🏛️	0	\N	10	0	t	f	t	{}	cmpvdh3cv0000k56f315d618r	cmp13wi7w00091v6ffmz8mvfl	2026-06-16 08:58:07.048	\N	Sağır Han, Mercan, Paşa Camii Sok. No:19, 34116 Fatih/İstanbul	\N	\N	/app/api/files/events/1781599967451-4ac4224299ec.jpg	\N	\N	f	English	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-06-19 20:49:44.674	f	TRY		t	\N	\N	f	\N	0	\N	cmpsks6sg0000kc6f1q7bq22w	\N	\N	social
