cmpve4h6i0000pw6fni3saxv7	Picnic at Caddebostan Seaside	<p>This Sunday we're spreading our blankets on the grass near the Caddebostan Büyük Kulüp pier — salty breeze, good people, and zero agenda. Just a slow, happy afternoon by the sea.</p><p></p><p>📅 <strong>Date:</strong> Sunday, 07 June 2026</p><p>🗺️ <strong>Location:</strong> Caddebostan Sahil — Near Büyük Kulüp pier</p><p>📍 <strong>Map link: </strong><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/xU3Qe5SZ2tajcGQBA">https://maps.app.goo.gl/xU3Qe5SZ2tajcGQBA</a></p><p>⏰ <strong>Time:</strong> 15:00</p><p>⏳ <strong>Duration:</strong> ~2 hours (but feel free to stay as long as you like!)</p><p></p><p>🙋 <strong>Host:</strong> Emre</p><p>💰 <strong>Fee:</strong> Free</p><p>🪑 <strong>Participants:</strong> 15 </p><p></p><p>🚻 <strong>Good to know</strong></p><p>· Municipality restrooms are nearby</p><p>· You can order groceries/snacks delivered straight to our spot🏪</p><p></p><p>🎒 <strong>What to bring</strong></p><p>· Folding chair or picnic blanket</p><p>· Your own food &amp; drinks</p><p>· Sunscreen</p><p>· Outdoor games &amp; sports gear (Football, Volleyball, Badminton, Frisbee) ⚽🏐🏸</p><p>· Fun card or board games (Uno, Taboo, etc.) 🃏🎲</p><p>· Your music playlists</p><p>· Good vibes, warm conversation &amp; your best smile ☀️</p><p></p><p>👕 <strong>Clothing</strong></p><p>Even on warm days, the seafront can get breezy — dress in layers so you can adjust!</p><p></p><p>⚠️ <strong>A few gentle reminders</strong></p><p>· Leave no trace — let's keep the shore as beautiful as we found it 🌿</p><p>· There's no fixed end time — come for two hours, stay for five, no pressure</p><p></p><p>If the weather turns moody, we'll keep each other warm with good chat 🫶</p>	2026-06-07	15:00	Caddebostan seaside	Caddebostan	🌿	0	\N	15	-1	t	f	t	{}	cmoz960by0000ym6f2nirdbck	cmp151klc0004wv6fwk4mjyal	2026-06-01 15:55:43.483	\N	Park İçi Yolu Caddebostan, 34728 Kadıköy/İstanbul	\N	\N	/app/api/files/events/1