cmq05pjr4003ave6fdvrd2aei	Picnic in Moda	<p>Join us for a delightful afternoon under the sun at our Picnic in Moda! This is the perfect opportunity to gather with fellow Smileys members and soak in the vibrant atmosphere of one of Istanbul's most charming neighborhoods. Whether you're a local or new to the city, you'll find a warm community ready to share stories, laughter, and delicious treats.</p><p></p><p>Bring your favorite snacks, drinks, and a cozy blanket, and let’s create a feast together! We’ll enjoy games, music, and great conversations while surrounded by the beauty of nature. It’s all about unwinding, meeting new friends, and celebrating the joy of shared experiences. So, whether you’re a foodie, a nature lover, or just looking for a fun day out, this picnic is for you!</p><p></p><p>Stay tuned for the exact location, but rest assured, Moda will provide the perfect backdrop for our gathering. So, grab your friends and get ready for a day filled with joy, connections, and unforgettable moments. Don’t miss out on the fun—grab your spot and let’s make some memories together! See you there!</p>	2026-06-20	18:00	Moda Seaside	Moda	🌳	0	\N	60	26	f	f	t	{}	cmoz960by0000ym6f2nirdbck	cmpl8w8tk0027yf6fzeag3nzw	2026-06-04 23:59:00.928	\N	Moda Sahil Parki	\N	\N	/app/api/files/events/1781784517551-62cf14439dd5.jpg	\N	\N	t	\N	40.980197	29.029216	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	published	2026-06-20 03:09:58.957	f	TRY		f	\N	\N	f	c86653ee-4dd3-43b9-be14-7559d5f11d2a	88	\N	cmpsks6sg0000kc6f1q7bq22w	\N	\N	social
cmqh4yuf3003ozq6fkk7fib8w	Picnic at Göztepe Seaside	<p>This Sunday we're spreading our blankets on the grass near the Caddebostan Büyük Kulüp pier — salty breeze, good people, and zero agenda. Just a slow, happy afternoon by the sea.</p><p></p><p>📅 <strong>Date:</strong> Sunday, 21 June 2026</p><p>🗺️ <strong>Location:</strong> Göztepe Sahil — Near Büyük Kulüp pier</p><p>📍 <strong>Map link: </strong><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/xU3Qe5SZ2tajcGQBA">https://maps.app.goo.gl/xU3Qe5SZ2tajcGQBA</a></p><p>⏰ <strong>Time:</strong> 17:00</p><p>⏳ <strong>Duration:</strong> ~2 hours (but feel free to stay as long as you like!)</p><p></p><p>🙋 <strong>Host:</strong> Emre</p><p>💰 <strong>Fee:</strong> Free</p><p>🪑 <strong>Participants:</strong> 15</p><p></p><p>🚻 <strong>Good to know</strong></p><p>· Municipality restrooms are nearby</p><p>· You can order groceries/snacks delivered straight to our spot🏪</p><p></p><p>🎒 <strong>What to bring</strong></p><p>· Folding chair or picnic blanket</p><p>· Your own food &amp; drinks</p><p>· Sunscreen</p><p>· Outdoor games &amp; sports gear (Football, Volleyball, Badminton, Frisbee) ⚽🏐🏸</p><p>· Fun card or board games (Uno, Taboo, etc.) 🃏🎲</p><p>· Your music playlists</p><p>· Good vibes, warm conversation &amp; your best smile ☀️</p><p></p><p>👕 <strong>Clothing</strong></p><p>· Even on warm days, the seafront can get breezy — dress in layers so you can adjust!</p><p></p><p>⚠️ <strong>A few gentle reminders</strong></p><p>· Leave no trace — let's keep the shore as beautiful as we found it 🌿</p><p>· There's no fixed end time — come for two hours, stay for five, no pressure</p><p></p><p>If the weather turns moody, we'll keep each other warm with good chat 🫶</p>	2026-06-21	17:00	Caddebostan Büyük Kulüp pier	Göztepe	🌿	0	\N	15	11	t	f	t	{}	cmoz960by0000ym6f2nirdbck	cmp151klc0004wv6fwk4mjyal	2026-06-16 21:10:20.031	https://chat.whatsapp.com/JsqkgKm3Jip8gLfJp4gvKm	Park İçi Yolu Caddebostan, 34728 Ka